      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im looking for some help with my startup strategy. we r looking to integrate more ai into our workflow to really cut down on overhead and optimize the workforce. basically want to know how can i use ai to streamline things and reduce costs without causing way too much employee turnover or a total revolt in the office?",
