      "content": "Framing these transitions as a \"market alignment\" initiative—focusing on profit preservation and innovation rather than \"layoffs\"—can help soften the narrative for the team and stakeholders. Prioritize open and transparent communication that clearly outlines the business necessity of these changes and offers robust upskilling or outplacement support for affected employees. This approach often turns a negative perception of \"crutality\" into a logical, albeit painful, step toward securing the company's future.",
